{"seq":61,"slug":"web-codecs-media-processing","title":"WebCodecs 媒体处理","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# WebCodecs 媒体处理\n\n浏览器一直能播放视频，却长期不让你碰编解码器本身。`<video>` 替你解码，Media Source Extensions 替你喂封装好的分段，`getUserMedia` 给你一条已经压好的轨道——这些高层接口把「一帧 YUV 像素如何变成一段 H.264 比特流」彻底藏了起来。当你想做视频编辑器、云游戏客户端、浏览器内转码、或把每一帧喂给机器学习模型时，这层封装就从便利变成了枷锁。WebCodecs 把编解码器作为一等的、可脚本控制的对象暴露出来：你拿到 `VideoFrame`、`AudioData` 这样的原始媒体，也拿到 `EncodedVideoChunk` 这样的压缩块，自己决定它们如何流动。\n\n这个 hub 沿四条主线递进。**基础** 回答「为什么需要它、它的世界观是什么」：从 `<video>`/MSE/WebRTC 留下的能力缺口讲起，建立「编解码器—编码块—原始帧」这套贯穿全书的数据模型，并讲清 `VideoFrame` 与 `EncodedVideoChunk` 的所有权与生命周期。**解码** 是把压缩块还原成可显示帧的方向：`VideoDecoder`、`AudioDecoder` 两个解码器各自的配置与回调，以及把解封装、解码、渲染串成一条带时序与音画同步的流水线。**编码** 是反方向：`VideoEncoder` 如何产出编码块与解码器配置，码率控制的三种模式与数学，关键帧策略如何在画质、容错与延迟之间取舍。**实践** 落到真实工程：把 `VideoFrame` 直接画进 Canvas/WebGL/WebGPU，用可转移对象与 GPU 后端帧做到零拷贝，最后是落地形态、特性探测降级、封装库选型与边界划分。\n\n读者画像与推荐路径：若你完全没接触过底层媒体，按 1→2→3→4 顺序通读，基础章的三篇是后续所有内容的词汇表，不可跳过。若你已懂编解码概念、只想用 API，可从《编解码模型》直接跳到解码或编码章对应的接口篇。若你的目标是实时低延迟（直播、云游戏），重点读《解码流水线与时序》《关键帧与延迟》《性能与零拷贝》这条线。前置知识：熟悉 JavaScript 的 Promise 与 `ArrayBuffer`/TypedArray，了解 `<video>` 与 Canvas 的基本用法即可；不需要先懂信号处理或编解码器内部算法。\n\n边界很重要，这个 hub 只管「编解码器本身」。如何采集摄像头、如何用 RTCPeerConnection 做点对点实时传输与拥塞控制，属于 [WebRTC 媒体](../50_frontend-webrtc-media/_INTRODUCTION.md)；如何用 `<img>`/`<video>`/CDN 在页面层面优化加载、选 AVIF/WebP，属于 [图像与媒体优化](../46_frontend-image-media-optimization/_INTRODUCTION.md)；把重活搬到后台线程的通用机制（Worker 类型、`postMessage`、`SharedArrayBuffer`）属于 [Web Workers 卸载](../54_frontend-web-workers-offloading/_INTRODUCTION.md)；用 [WebAssembly](../10_webassembly/_INTRODUCTION.md) 跑自带的 libavcodec 这类软件编解码器，是 WebCodecs 不覆盖某个格式时的补位方案。本 hub 与它们在数据类型上对接（`VideoFrame` 可在三者之间转移），但只深讲编解码器这一段。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-webcodecs","title":"为何 WebCodecs","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/foundations/why-webcodecs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"codec-model","title":"编解码模型","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/foundations/codec-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"frames-chunks","title":"帧与编码块","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/foundations/frames-chunks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"decode","title":"解码","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/decode","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"video-decoder","title":"VideoDecoder 视频解码器","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/decode/video-decoder"},{"seq":2,"slug":"audio-decoder","title":"AudioDecoder 音频解码器","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/decode/audio-decoder"},{"seq":3,"slug":"decode-pipeline","title":"解码流水线与时序","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/decode/decode-pipeline"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"encode","title":"编码","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/encode","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"video-encoder","title":"VideoEncoder 视频编码器","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/encode/video-encoder"},{"seq":2,"slug":"encoding-parameters","title":"编码参数与码率控制","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/encode/encoding-parameters"},{"seq":3,"slug":"keyframes-latency","title":"关键帧与延迟","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/encode/keyframes-latency"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"integration-canvas-webgl","title":"与 Canvas/WebGL 集成","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/practice/integration-canvas-webgl"},{"seq":2,"slug":"webcodecs-performance","title":"性能与零拷贝","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/practice/webcodecs-performance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"webcodecs-in-practice","title":"落地与边界","url":"/h/frontend/web-codecs-media-processing/practice/webcodecs-in-practice"}]}]}